      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T08:21:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Style : we prefer to write our code in a return-fast style.\n\nif (mDnsTlsChecks.containsKey(target) \u0026\u0026 TextUtils.isEmpty(hostname)) return;\n\nNote that in this case it\u0027s much clearer with the reversed check that it\u0027s really a bizarre thing to test. You want to overwrite, except if the hostname is empty ? Why ?",
